# the garden survives a restart: SAVE, then the same plants, lineage, gardener and lines; it saves by itself, rarely,
# while growing; another firmware's saved data (AMB-1 Drift's) or a damaged project gives a new garden
wait 300
expect store_writes 0
tap HOME
spin K2 2
tapkey 5
tapkey 12
wait 600000
tap SAVE
wait 20
snap
reboot
expect same 1
expect growth 3
expect yours 2
wait 300
expect playing 1
shot after_reboot.png
# a long while growing: saves itself, rarely (wear: once an hour at most; autosave.amb). Three so far: the growth
# setting at 5 minutes, SAVE, the hour's
wait 3600000
expect saves 3
expect store_writes 3
# resting: a setting saved a few seconds after a change, 5 minutes after the last save at least
spin K3 -5
tap PLAY
wait 300000
expect dirty 0
snap
reboot
expect same 1
expect par1 65
# AMB-1 Drift's project in the store: a new garden, not a misread one
foreign
reboot
wait 300
expect seconds <2
expect living 3
expect growth 1
expect par1 70
shot foreign.png
# ours, damaged: a new garden too
wait 60000
tap SAVE
junk
reboot
wait 300
expect seconds <2
expect living 3
